text = "Congratulations on finishing the quiz!

Every correct answer, every new fact you learned just now, was fabricated. Every question's solution was either a distortion of reality or entirely made up with no verifiable basis. You would be in the right to feel like none of this mattered.
Although this will likely not stop your subconscious from holding onto some of that information as if it was true. So, what if you never got the confirmation that everything was fake? What if the questions were about health and safety or politics? To what extent would that affect you and everyone else?
Would it matter then?

Thank you for playing and stay safe!"
